WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.216
Resume after no-shock advice.

00:00:02.216 --> 00:00:07.795
If the AED advises no shock, restart continuous compressions immediately.

00:00:07.795 --> 00:00:18.112
Continue until the emergency team takes over, the AED directs that nobody touch the casualty, or the casualty resumes normal breathing.
